z, we converted a heritage building into a state-of-the-art winery. We use smaller tanks to take advantage of higher fruit quality and keep wine batches separate so that we can make more reserve, varietal and super premium wines.</font></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-bdd3" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-26_"><div class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-27_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-28_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-29_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-31_"><font color="#ffffff">Experiences</font></span></h1></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-32_ pf-r pf-c-cb" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-33_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL huUGBz pf-34_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0608/9428/1940/t/3/assets/separator-1650718943655.png?v=1650718944" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0608/9428/1940/t/3/assets/separator-1650718943655.png?v=1650718944 1536w" width="5000" height="100"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-15f4" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-35_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-36_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-37_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL huUGBz pf-38_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0608/9428/1940/t/3/assets/blending-1650933581503.jpg?v=1650933582" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0608/9428/